; A placeholder groups its sub-accounts. Beancount has no such idea, so this stays a valid ledger,
; and a posting to a placeholder by hand counts in both: BranchBooks flags it in the budget instead.
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-01-01 open Assets:Checking USD
  budget: "on"
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food
  budget: "placeholder"
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries
2026-01-01 open Income:Salary

2026-01-02 * "Pay"
  Assets:Checking  1000.00 USD
  Income:Salary

2026-01-03 * "In its sub-account"
  Expenses:Food:Groceries  40.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2026-01-04 * "On the placeholder, by hand"
  Expenses:Food  5.00 USD
  Assets:Checking
